#: ../../source/libraries/data/graph_world.md:3
msgid ""
"`GraphWorld` visualizes an undirected graph. Nodes are placed at explicit"
" pixel positions; edges are drawn as lines between them. The world is "
"well-suited for BFS, DFS, Dijkstra and other graph traversal tasks."
msgstr ""

